        },
        {
          "text": "I rundi pier abic wi arionde pa Azaria m’ubimo mi Yuda, Peka ma wod Remalia maku camu ker wi Israel i Samaria, man ecamu ker rundi pier ario. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
