          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E etimo gin ma rac i wang’ Yehova: eweko dubo pa Yeroboam ma wod Nebat ungo, m’eketho Israel udubo kudo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I nindo pa Peka m’ubimo mir Israel, Tiglat-pileser m’ubimo mir Ascur ubino, man emaku Ijon, kud Abelbeth-maka, man Yanoa, man Kedec, ku Hazor, man Gilead ku Galilaya, man ng’om ceke pa Naftali; e eyakugi ni ng’eca i Ascur. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Hocea ma wod Ela giporo lembe kum Peka ma wod Remalia, e egoye, enege de, man ecamu ker kakare i rundi pier arionde pa Yotham ma wod Uzia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nie dong’ tic pa Peka, ku gin ceke m’etimo, nen, gigore i kitabu mi lemkei mir ubimo mir Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I rundi mir arionde pa Peka ma wod Remalia m’ubimo mir Israel, Yotham ma wod Uzia m’ubimo mi Yuda maku camu ker. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rundi pare pier ario wi abic kinde m’emaku camu ker; man ecamu ker rundi apar wi abusiel i Yerusalem: man nying’ min mire Yeruca ma nya Zadok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man etimo gin m’atira i wang’ Yehova; etimo calku gin ceke ma won mire ma Uzia timo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento jukabu ka ma malu woko ngo: dhanu gilamu lam, man giwang’u udok ma ng’wice ng’ar i ka ma malu asu. Eguro dhugang’ ma malu mi ot pa Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nie dong’ tic pa Yotham, ku gin ceke m’etimo, gigore i kitabu mi lemkei mir ubimo mi Yuda ngo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I ceng’ maeca Yehova maku oro Rezin m’ubimo mi Cami, man Peka ma wod Remalia kum Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Yotham unindo ku kwaru pare, man juyike ku kwaru pare i adhura pa Daudi ma kwaru mire: man Ahaz ma wode camu ker kakare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
